fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkanlib/vkinstance.html#gst_vulkan_instance_get_api_version","fragment":"\n\tgst_vulkan_instance_get_api_version\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanInstance.prototype.get_api_version\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanInstance.get_api_version\n\nReturns the vulkan API version configured when constructing the\nGstVulkanInstance. This value can be any valid Vulkan API version and may\nnot match gst_vulkan_instance_get_version in any way.  This version is the\nmaximum allowed vulkan API to be used in any capacity.\nThis will not return valid values until gst_vulkan_instance_open has been\ncalled.\nParameters:\na GstVulkanInstance\nmajor version\nminor version\npatch version\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReturns the vulkan API version configured when constructing the\nGstVulkan.VulkanInstance. This value can be any valid Vulkan API version and may\nnot match GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.prototype.get_version in any way.  This version is the\nmaximum allowed vulkan API to be used in any capacity.\nThis will not return valid values until GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.prototype.open has been\ncalled.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanInstance\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReturns the vulkan API version configured when constructing the\nGstVulkan.VulkanInstance. This value can be any valid Vulkan API version and may\nnot match GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.get_version in any way.  This version is the\nmaximum allowed vulkan API to be used in any capacity.\nThis will not return valid values until GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.open has been\ncalled.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanInstance\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});